    "message": "Read frozen event values as mappings where they were skipped\n\nFour checks tested values taken from an event's frozen payload or\nprovenance with isinstance(..., dict). Frozen objects are mappingproxy,\nso each check was always false and its work was silently skipped:\n\n- closing a route never stopped a worker walking on it;\n- a scheduled temporary room's ID was not counted when approving\n  another room;\n- a scheduled temporary space's capacity was not counted against the\n  per-zone bound;\n- the floor-plan history dropped the intervention's assumption IDs.\n\nCheck for Mapping instead, and test each on the generated Scenario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
